Subject: CPMS I03B Faithful JSON Byte Ingress

Description: Canonical formation for the bounded byte-level gate that preserves exact JSON identity and refuses duplicate names, malformed text, trailing data, and exhausted resources before schema, serde, semantic, or authority observation. Formation grants no implementation authority.

