& [Purpose] is identity-preserving admission to later pure readers
  + observe supplied bytes once without rewriting
  + release an immutable faithful instance only after every ingress gate closes
  + make duplicate identity numeric token structure resource work and faults inspectable

& [AuthorityStack] remains ordered
  + I03B byte ingress precedes I03D schema and serde observation
  + faithful ingress pass means only that byte text grammar duplicate and resource conditions passed
  + no later reader may reinterpret an I03B fault as acceptance
  + no I03B pass implies schema serde semantic authority or compatibility acceptance

& [GateOrder] is deterministic
  * refuse input longer than 16777216 bytes without scanning beyond the bound
  * refuse exact leading UTF-8 BOM EF BB BF
  * validate the complete byte sequence as strict UTF-8
  * skip only JSON whitespace and refuse empty or whitespace-only input
  * scan one JSON value with lexical structural duplicate and resource checks in source order
  * skip trailing JSON whitespace and refuse any remaining byte as trailing_data
  * finalize digest accounts and accepted instance atomically

& [UTF8Profile] is strict
  + reject overlong invalid continuation truncated surrogate-encoded and above-U+10FFFF sequences
  + report the first known invalid zero-based byte offset
  + perform no Unicode normalization

& [Whitespace] is exactly U+0020 U+0009 U+000A or U+000D represented by one ASCII byte

& [StringProfile] is scalar faithful
  + reject unescaped U+0000 through U+001F
  + accept only JSON-defined simple escapes and exact four-hex-digit Unicode escapes
  + combine a high-surrogate escape only with its immediately following low-surrogate escape
  + reject every unpaired reversed or interrupted surrogate escape
  + retain raw half-open token span and decode member names to exact scalar sequences

& [MemberIdentity] is object local
  + exact decoded scalar sequence is the key
  + escape spelling differences that decode equally are duplicates
  + Unicode normalization case folding locale mapping and confusable mapping are forbidden
  + each open object uses a deterministic BTreeMap from decoded name to first opening-quote offset
  + second occurrence faults before its colon value or descendants can acquire observation authority

& [NumberProfile] is grammar and span only
  + optional minus
  + integer is zero or nonzero digit followed by digits
  + optional fraction requires decimal point and one or more digits
  + optional exponent requires e or E optional sign and one or more digits
  + retain sign integer fraction exponent component spans and exact raw source span
  + reject leading plus leading zero missing digits nonfinite hexadecimal and locale forms
  + never convert to f64 as an ingress decision

& [LiteralProfile] accepts only exact lowercase true false and null
& [RootKinds] are null boolean number string array and object

& [Depth] counts open containers
  + scalar root depth 0
  + root array or object depth 1
  + maximum 128 is inclusive
  + attempt to enter depth 129 faults before frame creation

& [Counts] are aggregate document accounts
  + object members maximum 65536
  + array items maximum 65536
  + scalar values maximum 131072 and member names do not count as scalar values
  + each decoded member name maximum 4096 UTF-8 bytes
  + each number token maximum 4096 source bytes
  + maximum path segments 128
  + every count offset index and span operation uses checked arithmetic

& [Path] is structured
  + member segments carry exact decoded String
  + index segments carry zero-based u64
  + authoritative value is the segment vector
  + derived JSON Pointer renders tilde as ~0 and solidus as ~1
  + malformed input uses the deepest fully known path and invents no segment

& [Offsets] are exact
  + zero is the first supplied byte
  + spans are start inclusive end exclusive
  + EOF fault offset equals input byte length
  + duplicate offsets point to each member-name opening quote

& [LimitsForm] contains exact nine maxima
  + input_bytes 16777216 container_depth 128 object_members 65536 array_items 65536 scalar_values 131072
  + member_name_bytes 4096 number_token_bytes 4096 path_segments 128 diagnostic_characters 1024

& [AcceptedInstance] is closed
  + fixed profile
  + exact limits
  + owned original Vec u8
  + SHA256 ContentDigest over those bytes
  + JsonRootKind
  + accounts for bytes maximum depth members items scalars number tokens decoded-name bytes and maximum name bytes
  + ordered JsonNumberToken spans and components
  - never: generic Value schema object typed form semantic result or authority disposition

& [FaultCodes] are closed
  + invalid_utf8 forbidden_bom empty_input malformed_json trailing_data duplicate_key limit_exceeded internal_fault
& [GrammarClasses] are closed
  + expected_value expected_key expected_colon expected_comma_or_end invalid_literal invalid_number invalid_string invalid_escape invalid_unicode_escape unpaired_surrogate unexpected_closer unexpected_eof
& [FaultEvidence] contains code stage optional grammar class offset path and bounded advisory message
  + duplicate fault additionally contains decoded name first offset and second offset
  + limit fault additionally contains limit kind maximum and attempted observed value
  + engine debug and display strings are never stable identity

& [Atomicity] is strict
  + internal frames member maps token observations and accounts are provisional
  + any fault destroys provisional state and returns exactly one fault
  + no warning partial instance partial Value or pass accompanies a fault

& [ScannerArchitecture] is iterative and deterministic
  + explicit object and array frames encode expected grammar state
  + stack length equals open container depth
  + object frames own BTreeMap decoded name to first offset
  + scanner indexes exact source bytes and copies only accepted source bounded names paths and token metadata
  + closed object maps are dropped
  + sha256_bytes from cantor_core supplies the digest

& [FutureSourceTouch] is unsigned and exact
  + modify crates/cantor_procedure_tool/src/lib.rs
  + add crates/cantor_procedure_tool/src/json_ingress.rs
  + add crates/cantor_procedure_tool/tests/json_ingress.rs
  - never: Cargo lock dependency core CLI MCP service ecosystem preflight schema golden or runtime effect file

& [Proof] after future activation is adversarial and complete
  + six root kinds exact whitespace and positive nested documents
  + every malformed lexical structural string escape surrogate number separator closer and EOF family
  + raw escaped nested and scope-separated duplicate names
  + below at and above every finite maximum
  + exact paths offsets spans accounts digests fault fields and repeat equality
  + complete locked offline debug release formatting lint docs audit evidence and diff gates

& [FormationBoundary] is strict
  + current slice adds source SJS canonical exploded requirements justification plan review inactive lock proof narrative and evidence metadata only
  - never: Rust parser Cargo schema serde semantic authority compatibility provider model service persistence network effect production hardware or FPGA

& [PresentDisposition] is formed_not_activated
